extends layout.pug

block title
  | Alliance agreement paused

block content
  p Hi #{name},
  p The Alliance relies on the dependability of all members. Since you missed an assigned non-optional task in each of the last 3 weeks you had tasks, we've paused your agreement automatically. You can join again any time:
  +button(link, "Join again")
  p If this was in error or if you have any questions, please contact us.
